## Summary: Complete Sync Event Flow

```
Local Edit
  ↓
Lua → layer.push() / layer.set()
  ↓
Loro commit() → Observer fires
  ↓
diff_event_to_ops() / convert_loro_diff_to_delta()
  ↓
PageUpdate::LayerChanged → Emit to page_update_subscribers
  ↓
Observer broadcast_update() → Send BroadcastPayload to all subscribers
  ↓
emit_sync_events_for_missing_targets() → EnsureSync for unsubscribed users
  ↓
Coordinator receives EnsureSync → Connects peer → Subscribe flow begins

---

Remote Update (Peer Sends)
  ↓
PeerActor → ApplyUpdate message to Scribe
  ↓
handle_apply_update() → Check permissions
  ↓
apply_crdt_update() → Set pending_update_source → layer.import()
  ↓
Observer fires with from_peer set
  ↓
emit_dynamic_layer_permits() [if new dynamic layer detected]
  ↓
find_matching_dynamic_schema() → Validate creator DID → prepare_layer_permits()
  ↓
PermitIssuer.issue_layer_permit() → Ready-to-send permits
  ↓
SyncEvent::NewDynamicLayer → Emit to Coordinator
  ↓
Coordinator stores + distributes permits to connected peers
  ↓
Peer receives LayerPermit → AuthorizeLayerSubscriber → Subscribe
```

